-title: 'Supabase Auth: Build vs. Buy'
-description: 'The reasons why (and why not) to use Supabase Auth instead of building your own.'
-categories:
-  - auth
-tags:
-  - auth
-date: '2025-08-12:10:00'
-toc_depth: 2
